":"ਜਿਤ ਤਿਤ ਡੋਲਤ ਫੂਲੇ ॥","translit_en":"jit tit ddolat foole ||","translation":{"pu":{"ss":"ਜਿਥੇ ਕਿਥੇ (ਖੁਸ਼ੀ ਨਾਲ) ਫੁਲੇ ਘੁੰਮਦੇ ਫਿਰਦੇ ਹਨ"}}},{"verse_id":103966,"page_no":674,"line_no":103966,"gurmukhi":"ਗ੍ਰਿਹ ਕੇ ਸਬ ਦੁਖ ਭੂਲੇ ॥੪੮੩॥","translit_en":"gireh ke sab dhukh bhoole ||483||","translation":{"en":{"bdb":"They forgot their domestic worries and moved here and there happily.483."},"pu":{"ss":"ਅਤੇ ਘਰ ਦੇ ਸਾਰੇ ਦੁਖ ਭੁਲ ਗਏ ਹਨ ॥੪੮੩॥"}}}],"nav":{"prev":9375,"next":9377}}